From: Oreon Packaging Team <packaging@oreonhq.com>
Subject: [PATCH] build with flit_core 4

flit_core 4 no longer reads [tool.flit.metadata]; tomli-w already uses
the [project] table. flit's 4.0 release notes say such projects can
raise the cap from <4 to <5.
---
--- a/pyproject.toml	2026-11-23 15:20:07.234904929 -0800
+++ b/pyproject.toml	2026-11-23 15:20:07.234904929 -0800
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 [build-system]
-requires = ["flit_core>=3.2.0,<4"]
+requires = ["flit_core>=3.2.0,<5"]
 build-backend = "flit_core.buildapi"
 
 [project]
